ariable so that it can be reconfigured for custom\\n\\t// logging configurations.\\n\\tDefaultLogger func(next http.Handler) http.Handler\\n)\\n\\n// Logger is a middleware that logs the start and end of each request, along\\n// with some useful data about what was requested, what the response status was,\",\n          \"end_line\": 24,\n          \"path\": \"middleware/logger.go\",\n          \"source_id\": \"source-44b49706fed7\",\n          \"start_line\": 1\n        }\n      ],\n      \"summary\": \"该主题聚焦 `middleware` 模块中的中间件能力。\",\n      \"title\": \"middleware能力：中间件\",\n      \"topic_key\": \"module-fb4109464cc5-middleware\",\n      \"topic_kind\": \"module-capability\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"input_hash\": \"f4fab74ff0ec89d09ff5d4230cf2e5f539bee7ea3cb85ff157de9f2c50d258a0\",\n  \"instruction\": \"页面类型：topic\\n页面标题：middleware能力：中间件\\n页面作用域：topic:module-capability:module-fb4109464cc5-middleware\\nchild rollups 数量：0\\nmodule dossiers 数量：1\\ntopic dossier：true\\nevidence groups 数量：1\\ndiagram inputs 数量：0\\n输出要求：\\n1. 最终结果必须严格符合 response_schema，对应 `PageResearchResult`。\\n2. `summary` 只能写 1 段高密度摘要，不得输出 Markdown 页面或 section 标题。\\n3. `key_points` 只保留最关键的 3 到 7 条结论。\\n4. `evidence_rollup` 只能引用当前输入中已存在的 evidence group / source path。\\n5. `diagram_rollup` 只能引用 deterministic 已存在的 diagram inputs。\\n6. 若信息不足，可提出 `open_questions`，但不得凭空捏造事实。\\n7. 若工具调用有帮助，可以先调用工具，再返回最终结构化结果。\",\n  \"prompt_type\": \"page_research\",\n  \"prompt_version\": \"page-research/v1\",\n  \"response_schema\": {\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"diagram_rollup\": {\n        \"items\": {\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"diagram_key\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"diagram_type\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"summary\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"title\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"diagram_key\",\n   